{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up.  Take down bosses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a cooperative boss-rush experience built for action. <br>Fight solo or alongside up to three friends with seamless teamwork, every encounter is a test of reflexes, coordination, and built-up knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/6dbcf32da83996ef488a31442d339303.poster.avif?t=1755177349\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/6dbcf32da83996ef488a31442d339303.webm?t=1755177349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/6dbcf32da83996ef488a31442d339303.mp4?t=1755177349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight. Power up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, choose from a selection of powerful upgrades to enhance your character\u2019s abilities, buff yourself or your team, then &quot;accidentally&quot; kill your friends while they're distracted by the new shiny gear.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/86d6f75459fa1b2fa88ccb7c769563d5.poster.avif?t=1755177349\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/86d6f75459fa1b2fa88ccb7c769563d5.webm?t=1755177349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/86d6f75459fa1b2fa88ccb7c769563d5.mp4?t=1755177349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Die. Learn. Try again.</strong><br>Dodge telegraphed attacks, use abilities wisely, and master raid-like mechanics that reward teamwork and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/811a32704d5476387b1d1ef44714f1c6.poster.avif?t=1755177349\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/811a32704d5476387b1d1ef44714f1c6.webm?t=1755177349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/811a32704d5476387b1d1ef44714f1c6.mp4?t=1755177349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Coordinate, or fall apart.</strong><br>Only the synchronized survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/dd4f6f32739f0bbb73f40df8a9663160.poster.avif?t=1755177349\" width=616 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/dd4f6f32739f0bbb73f40df8a9663160.webm?t=1755177349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/dd4f6f32739f0bbb73f40df8a9663160.mp4?t=1755177349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die some more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each defeat is an opportunity to improve, sharpen your timings, flow, and push deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867960/extras/5f801650ea68af15e74d791aba8dc703.poster.avif?t=1755177349\" width=616 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i